    'pain.kicker': 'When life changes', 'pain.title': 'Knowing where you want to go is only the beginning.', 'pain.complement': 'The challenge is also organizing the journey, one day at a time.', 'pain.body': 'Food, water, movement, commitments and rest all compete for your time. When life changes, it makes sense to rethink the next step. REROUTE starts from that reality, without blame or demands for perfection.',
    'pain.item1': 'Without guilt', 'pain.item2': 'Without starting from zero', 'pain.item3': 'Without relying on a perfect routine', 'pain.item4': 'With realistic adjustments that keep you moving forward',
    'audience.kicker': 'Who it is for', 'audience.title': 'REROUTE was created for people who...', 'audience.lead': 'For people working toward weight loss who want more structure in everyday life.',
    'audience.title1': 'Try to lose weight but lose consistency', 'audience.body1': 'They start motivated but struggle to maintain momentum over the weeks.',
